contentText:
After drawing ire from disgruntled football fans in 2023 who felt she was present at too many games, Taylor Swift has managed to irk men in another sport for apparently attending too few. New York Knicks point guards Tyler Kolek and Miles &#8220;Deuce&#8221; McBride recently criticized the pop star as the &#8220;fakest&#8221; fan of the 2026 NBA champions, accusing her and other celebrity row visitors of being &#8220;performative.&#8221;

